     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: pangloss<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=487398<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>I believe this behavior was introduced with the RI refactoring in 2.2. </p>\n\n<p>BaseTripleGenerator.add(SubjectNode subject, PredicateNode predicate, Date dateValue, Set&lt;Triple&gt; set) is calling DateUtility.convertDateToString() which (rightfully) isn't mindful of XSD dateTime considerations.</p>\n\n<p>I'll commit a fix for this in dev-143888 (Update Trippi for Mulgara).</p>",
